{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","自然之怒"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Force of Nature"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","创造持续数秒的乌云，降下雷电打击敌人。敌人处于控制状态时，敌人会受到更多次雷击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Arden creates a dark cloud that strikes enemies with lightning for several seconds. Enemies are subjected to more lightning strikes when controlled."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，对该格2格范围内的所有敌人造成160% + 20% ATK伤害，同时在该范围上空生成持续7秒的乌云，乌云会雷击下方处于控制状态的敌人，造成80% + 10% ATK伤害。同一名敌人每2秒最多被雷击1次。优先选择敌军最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Arden selects a tile and casts lightning strikes on all surrounding enemies within 2 tiles, dealing 160% + 20% ATK damage and creating a dark cloud that lingers for 7s. The dark cloud will repeatedly strike controlled enemies below with lightning, dealing 80% + 10% ATK damage each time. An enemy can only be struck once every 2s. Arden prioritizes selecting the tile with the most surrounding enemies when casting the lightning strikes."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":259,"end":265,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":256,"end":269,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成180% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成90% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Deals 180% + 20% ATK damage with the first lightning strike, and 90% + 10% ATK damage with the subsequent lightning strike."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":68,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成190% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成95% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Deals 190% + 20% ATK damage with the first lightning strike, and 95% + 10% ATK damage with the subsequent lightning strike."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":68,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成100% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Deals 200% + 20% ATK damage with the first lightning strike, and 100% + 10% ATK damage with the subsequent lightning strike."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":75,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成210% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成110% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Deals 210% + 20% ATK damage with the first lightning strike, and 110% + 10% ATK damage with the subsequent lightning strike."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":75,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","根须缠绕"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Entangling Vines"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使2名敌人被缠绕并受到持续伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Arden summons vines to entangle 2 enemies and deals continuous damage to them."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放藤蔓缠绕距离自己最近的2名敌军，缠绕持续2 + 0.25秒，期间敌人无法行动，并且每1秒会受到雅顿50% ATK的伤害。乌云存在期间，本技能优先选择乌云下方的敌军作为目标。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Arden summons vines to entangle 2 closest enemies for 2 + 0.25s, making them unable to move or act while dealing 50% ATK damage every 1s. Arden prioritizes enemies under the dark cloud."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":55,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":113,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至55% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 55% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 60% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至65% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 65% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","自然馈赠"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Nature's Resilience"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","当敌方英雄处于控制状态时，雅顿恢复能量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Arden recovers Energy for himself when enemies are controlled."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当有召唤物以外的敌军处于控制状态时，雅顿恢复12 + 3点能量，每名敌军每2秒至多触发1次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Arden recovers 12 + 3 Energy whenever a non-summoned enemy is controlled. This effect can trigger once per enemy every 2s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每名敌军每1.5秒至多触发1次。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Triggers once per enemy every 1.5s."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每名敌军每1秒至多触发1次。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Triggers once per enemy every 1s."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","恢复的能量提升至15 + 3点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Recovers 15 + 3 Energy."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":11,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","春雷化雨"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Spring Thunderstorm"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能后，立即缠绕乌云下目标。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Arden entangles enemies under the dark cloud immediately after casting Force of Nature."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","雅顿释放终极技能“自然之怒”后，会立即以乌云下所有的敌军为目标释放一次“根须缠绕”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Arden casts Entangling Vines on all enemies under the dark cloud once after casting Force of Nature."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","雅顿的终极技能“自然之怒”生效范围变为3格范围。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the range of Force of Nature to 3 tiles."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能释放的“根须缠绕”造成的缠绕时间延长至3秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the duration of Entangling Vines to 3s."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能释放的“根须缠绕”造成的缠绕时间延长至3.5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the duration of Entangling Vines to 3.5s."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“自然之怒”对同一名敌人的最小雷击间隔减少。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Arden reduces the lightning strike interval of Force of Nature for the same enemy."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“自然之怒”对同一名敌军的最小雷击间隔减少-1秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Arden reduces the lightning strike interval of Force of Nature for the same enemy by -1s."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","苍翠之枝"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Jade Vine"]]}